  "title": "Law360 highlights how law firms are innovating with new funding models",
  "summary": "Law360 reports on how law firms are innovating their funding of business operations. On a panel in Chicago, Vice Chair David Perla said that since law firms need more capital than they can raise from their partners to acquire talent and technology, \"[o]utside capital is finding its way into law firms through channels such as marketing and back offices.\" Learn more.",
